# "If The Darkness Crystal leaves the battlefield at the same time as one or more nontoken creatures an opponent controls
# would die, those creature cards will be exiled and you'll gain 2 life for each of them" (the ruling): the Crystal is still
# on the battlefield as the event would happen, so its replacement applies to it (CR 614.1).
# On turn 3 Bot1's Ultima destroys the Crystal and Bot2's Ornithopter at once: the Ornithopter is exiled, and Bot1 gains 2.
# Ultima ends the turn, so it is exiled as it resolves (CR 724.1b).
# The Darkness Crystal {2}{B}{B}: Legendary Artifact
#   Black spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.
#   If a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, instead exile it and you gain 2 life.
#   {4}{B}{B}, {T}: Put target creature card exiled with The Darkness Crystal onto the battlefield tapped under your control with two additional +1/+1 counters on it.

